WEBVTT

00:26:00.454 --> 00:26:04.496
You may be at risk of tolerating
circumstances which you wouldn't tolerate

00:26:04.496 --> 00:26:06.663
if you would come of age in
better economic times.

00:26:07.079 --> 00:26:09.371
And why does it last? I'm thinking about

00:26:09.371 --> 00:26:13.246
the common finding that we adapt pretty
quickly to our circumstances

00:26:13.246 --> 00:26:14.788
and start to get used to them.

00:26:15.246 --> 00:26:19.288
So why in 10 or 15 or 20 years
after the recession is over,

00:26:19.579 --> 00:26:21.746
am I still thankful for having a job?

00:26:22.579 --> 00:26:24.288
Usually when people get their first jobs,

00:26:24.288 --> 00:26:26.663
it's in this period of life called
the impressionable years.

00:26:26.663 --> 00:26:30.871
Most people are beginning to forge an
identity outside of their families